From: q2q port
Subject: [PATCH] q2q: Fold3 inner touchscreen (STM FTS9CU80F on SPI SE4)

Polled driver for the Galaxy Z Fold3 inner touch controller: GCC votes and TCXO root for
QUP wrapper-0 SE4, FIFO-mode GENI SPI (mode 0, GPIO23 chip select), FTS chip id / reset /
scan-on, 16-byte event decoding, and sweet_hid_touch() reports mapped through the rotated
presentation (patch 0903). Progress is drawn in the left black bar. Boot-args: q2qtouch,
q2qtouchdelay, q2qtouchdiv, q2qtmx, q2qtmy, q2qtswap, q2qtfx, q2qtfy.

---
